# Never commit a machine's own config: any *.env carries connection details and
# credentials (this server's service-config.env, or the bus-config.env the
# onboarding kit has each machine create), and a launcher carries an instance id
# and local paths. Bare patterns match at any depth, because a kit may sit inside
# a clone. The tracked template bus-config.env.example deliberately does not match.
*.env
bus-watch.cmd
bus-watch.sh
